/**

- Migrations are tracked by Prisma under this folder.
-
- Each time `prisma migrate dev --name <label>` is run, Prisma:
- 1. Compares schema.prisma against the current DB state.
- 2. Generates a timestamped SQL migration file here.
- 3. Applies the migration to the development database.
- 4. Records the migration in the _prisma_migrations table.
-
- Commit the full contents of this folder to version control so that
- all environments (CI, staging, production) apply migrations in the
- same order via `prisma migrate deploy`.
-
- Do NOT edit migration files manually after they have been applied.
  */
